## Takeaways

- The onboarding changes shipped on 2026-07-20 line up with the jump from 48 to 51 percent at month 1, between the July and August cohorts.
- The biggest drop is always between month 0 and month 1.
- September's cohort is the largest, at 29,800 signups, and is also the best retaining so far.
